    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        473.5420837402344,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Testing capacity should be secured for the second test, as volumes will increase.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9666137695312,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Adequate staffing capacity and training are needed to improve the collection of different",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        383.7728271484375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "sample types and laboratory processing of collected samples.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9973754882812,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Performing the same test on a new sample may need additional regulatory approval on a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.16119384765625,
        241.1708984375,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "national and international level.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        146.66119384765625,
        519.6642456054688,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Infrastructure and training on how to collect a stool sample privately should be available.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        162.16119384765625,
        527.1402587890625,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "As with all WHO-recommended TB diagnostics, quality assurance programmes for both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.66119384765625,
        214.38699340820312,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "sample types are required.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        193.16119384765625,
        527.0745849609375,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "At a primary health care level, in a situation of sputum paucity or absence, stool and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.66119384765625,
        527.228515625,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "nasopharyngeal aspirate may be feasible, whereas collection of more invasive specimen",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        224.16119384765625,
        527.2611083984375,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "types (i.e. induced sputum, BAL and gastric aspirate) would require upward referral,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        239.66119384765625,
        526.7552490234375,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "depending local capacity and expertise. In these circumstances, performing stool testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        255.16119384765625,
        526.975341796875,
        268.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "at primary health care level and waiting for a test result before upward referral of the child",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        270.66119384765625,
        184.47889709472656,
        283.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "may be appropriate.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.0075378417969,
        246.56613159179688,
        315.38751220703125
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.6383972167969,
        78.81909942626953,
        338.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        325.6383972167969,
        527.2338256835938,
        338.7834167480469
      ],
      "text": "Monitor simultaneous specimen collection and turnaround time for the test results in a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        341.1383972167969,
        227.41049194335938,
        354.2834167480469
      ],
